{"approved":false,"back_sample":null,"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"flow-rate-calculator UI copy.howAnswer","detected_language":"sw","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"flow-rate-calculator.copy.howAnswer","keys":["flow-rate-calculator.copy.howAnswer"],"locale":"sw","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"Kwa mtiririko imara kupitia sehemu, kiwango cha mtiririko wa volumetric Q sawa na eneo la sehemu ya msalaba A kuzidishwa na kasi ya wastani v: Q = A × v. Kukadiria wakati wa kujaza, kugawa kiasi chombo na kiwango cha mtiririko. Mifumo halisi inaweza kutofautiana na shinikizo, msuguano, fittings, mali ya maji na viwango vya kubadilika.","record_id":"06b5160a670a1761396b4e31729d242491600804c384046f6a02796bd63b41ff","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"40565692987","seconds":1.9528687167500038,"source":"For steady flow through a section, volumetric flow rate Q equals cross-sectional area A multiplied by average velocity v: Q = A × v. To estimate filling time, divide container volume by flow rate. Real systems can vary with pressure, friction, fittings, fluid properties and changing levels.","source_commit":"e8a7cb94dc75d40f2c0e14bb27c0a1819e230012","source_hash":"1f3f4899f63ab5cc3e1f65d9265252070b9fa68d439aaa24dc4a03795f9b489f","status":"machine-draft","translation":"Kwa mtiririko imara kupitia sehemu, kiwango cha mtiririko wa volumetric Q sawa na eneo la sehemu ya msalaba A kuzidishwa na kasi ya wastani v: Q = A × v. Kukadiria wakati wa kujaza, kugawa kiasi chombo na kiwango cha mtiririko. Mifumo halisi inaweza kutofautiana na shinikizo, msuguano, fittings, mali ya maji na viwango vya kubadilika.","truncated":false,"warnings":[]}
